- **CLI Command**: Add a `refine` subcommand with required `--id <taskId>` and `--feedback <text>`, optional `--auto-apply` to apply AI suggestions automatically. Load task, generate refinements, update if approved, append to history, and save. Example:
  ```typescript
  program
    .command('refine')
    .description('Refine a task based on feedback and preserve history')
    .requiredOption('--id <taskId>', 'Task ID to refine')
    .requiredOption('--feedback <text>', 'Feedback for refinement')
    .option('--auto-apply', 'Automatically apply AI suggestions')
    .option('--task-file <path>', 'Path to tasks file', 'tasks.json')
    .action(async (options) => {
      const tasks = await loadTasks(options.taskFile);
